waitlog (nearest philipsruins:lost_soul_dungeon.* is at|type "?philipsruins:lost_soul_dungeon|philipsruins:lost_soul_dungeon.*timed out|Could not find) 200
reject nearest philipsruins:lost_soul_dungeon.* is at

